---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Gabion Baskets & Gabion Mesh — Sizes, Prices & Anping Factories" description="Welded and woven gabion baskets: standard sizes, mesh specs, coatings and filling guidance. Direct from Anping factories.">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0 prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">Gabion Baskets</h1>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">Gabions are wire mesh boxes filled with stone, used for retaining walls, riverbank protection, erosion control and landscaping. Anping supplies both types: <strong>welded gabions</strong> (rigid, sharp appearance, popular in Europe for architecture) and <strong>woven hexagonal gabions</strong> (flexible, cheaper, standard for civil works).</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Standard basket sizes</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Common sizes (m)</th><th>Mesh</th><th>Wire</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Welded</td><td>1×1×1, 2×1×1, 2×0.5×0.5, 1×0.5×0.5</td><td>50×50, 75×75, 100×100 mm</td><td>3.0–5.0 mm (+PVC)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Woven (hex)</td><td>2×1×1, 3×1×1, 4×1×1, 2×1×0.5</td><td>60×80, 80×100, 100×120 mm</td><td>2.0–3.0 mm (2.4/3.4 with PVC)</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Galvanizing options</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Galfan (Zn-5%Al)</strong> — best value for civil works, 2–3× life of plain zinc</li>
        <li><strong>Hot-dip galvanized</strong> — 60–100 g/m² zinc</li>
        <li><strong>Galvanized + PVC coated</strong> — green/grey, architectural & marine use</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">How to evaluate a gabion quote</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Check mesh size — welded gabions are quoted per m² or per basket; woven per m²</li>
        <li>Wire diameter before coating, and zinc coating weight (g/m²)</li>
        <li>Panel or roll origin — some suppliers buy mesh elsewhere and only assemble</li>
        <li>Accessories: spiral wires, clips, stiffeners/bracing wires (often excluded and needed!)</li>
        <li>Flat-packed volume per container — welded gabions ship knocked-down, ~15–20 m³ per 40'HC</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Price reference</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Product</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Spec</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Price Range (USD)</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">MOQ</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Lead Time</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Welded gabion, 1×1×1m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm, 4.0mm wire, Galfan</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$18–28/unit</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">200 units</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–25 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Welded gabion, 2×1×1m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">75×75mm, 4.0mm wire, Galfan</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$28–42/unit</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">200 units</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–25 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Woven gabion (per m²)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">80×100mm, 2.7mm wire, PVC</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$3.5–6/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">5000 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">PVC-coated welded gabion</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm, 4.0mm+0.5mm PVC</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$22–35/unit (1×1×1m)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">200 units</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20–30 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Spiral wires & clips (set)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">For 1×1×1m basket</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$1.5–2.5/set</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">500 sets</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">10–15 days</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted mb-6">*Indicative 2025–2026 ranges. Actual pricing depends on wire cost, zinc coating weight, order volume, and destination port. Always request formal quotes with accessory breakdown.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">FAQ</h2>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">How much stone does a 1×1×1 m basket hold?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">About 1.5–1.7 tonnes of 100–200 mm stone. Order stone locally — shipping stone is never economic.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">Welded vs woven — which for my project?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Welded: architecture, landscaping, straight walls, longer life. Woven: river works, dams, uneven terrain — it flexes without breaking.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">Typical MOQ?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">One container of baskets (usually 200–400 welded units or 5000+ m² woven). Anping factories accept mixed-size container loads.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">What's Galfan and why is it better?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Galfan is a zinc-aluminum alloy coating (Zn-5%Al). It provides 2–3 times the corrosion resistance of standard hot-dip galvanizing at only ~15% cost premium. Standard for civil engineering projects with 50+ year design life.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">How do I assemble gabion baskets on site?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Baskets ship flat-packed. Assemble by connecting side panels with spiral wires (for welded) or lacing wire (for woven). Use stiffeners/bracing wires every 1m during filling to prevent bulging. Fill in 250mm layers, hand-packed at face for appearance.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">What stone size should I use?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Use 100–200 mm (4–8 inch) angular stone for structural gabions. Rounded river rock is acceptable for decorative use. Stone must be harder than Mohs 3 to resist crushing. Void ratio ~30–35% for drainage.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">How do I calculate how many gabions fit in a container?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Use our <a href="/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">container loading calculator</a> — select "Gabion Baskets" product type, enter basket dimensions and quantity. Welded gabions ship knocked-down flat, maximizing container space.</p>
      </details>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">Get quotes from Anping gabion factories</p>
        <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block mt-3 accent-bg hover:accent-bg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors">Send an inquiry →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="lg:w-80 shrink-0">
      <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
        <!-- Quick Tools -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">QUICK TOOLS</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Calculate & Convert</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Weight Calculator
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Container Loading
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> FOB Price Calculator
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/charts/mesh-size-chart/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Mesh Size Chart
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Specs -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">QUICK SPECS</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Gabion Standards</h3>
          <dl class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Basket Size</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">1×1×1 to 4×1×1 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Welded Mesh</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">50×50 to 100×100 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Woven Mesh</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">60×80 to 100×120 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Wire Diameter</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">2.0–5.0 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Coating</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">Galfan / HDG<br/>+PVC optional</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Standards</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">ASTM A975<br/>EN 10223-8</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Products -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">RELATED</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Related Products</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Welded Wire Mesh
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/products/stainless-steel-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Stainless Steel Mesh
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/products/wire-mesh-fence-panels/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Fence Panels
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>
